window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"olaf","b":"masteryi","win":["Olaf","Olaf","Olaf","Olaf","Olaf","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1","text":"Axe slow plus sustain crush his weakest window"},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Ragnarok all-in before his Highlander"},{"when":"1st item (his)","text":"You still hold the duel through his first spike"},{"text":"Highlander makes him immune to every slow you own and Wuju Style's true damage ignores Ragnarok's resists — stop duelling him here.","when":"2+ items (his)"}],"wants":{"you":["Relentless early kill pressure","All-ins landed before Highlander is up","The game closed before his two-item spike"],"foe":["Surviving to two items","Meditate stalls under tower","Highlander duels where your slow does nothing"]},"early":"This is a stomp on a timer, so stomp: slow him with axes, chew him with Reckless Swing true damage and heal off everything he answers with. Don't spend E into Alpha Strike — he is untargetable through it. Meditate is a 10s channel you have no CC to break, so buy Executioner's and zone him off the wave.","mid":"Keep the boot down through 4-5 and go for the kill at 6, but be clear what Ragnarok is: armour, MR and disable immunity, not speed. Highlander is back every 85s and makes him immune to your slow, so land the all-in before he presses it. Every kill delays the two-item flip that ends your reign.","late":"At two of his items the duel inverts — Wuju Style's true damage out-bursts your healing — so retire from the 1v1 business. Group with your team and use Ragnarok to open on his carries. Peeling Yi is harder than it reads: Highlander makes him immune to every slow you own, so your axe only lands between his ults.","whys":["Your Undertow slow and lifesteal sustain crush his weak level 1 — swing first and keep swinging.","Reckless Swing true damage plus W keeps every early trade yours — he has nothing that out-trades it.","Sustain and the axe slow give you total lane control through 3 — he farms only what you allow.","Through 4-5 your DPS and sustain out-duel a still-squishy Yi — keep forcing the fight.","Ragnarok gives resists and disable immunity, but Highlander makes him immune to your slow — he can still leave.","Your true damage and sustain keep you ahead even through his first item — do not let the shop scare you off.","At two items Wuju Style's true damage and Highlander's resets out-burst your healing — the duel flips, so stop taking it."]});
